          "rawSql": "-- Daily average CO2, for every day since the first reading\r\n-- (local Melbourne days; today is left out until it's complete).\r\nWITH daily AS (\r\n    SELECT time_bucket(INTERVAL '1 day', bucket, 'Australia/Melbourne') AS day_start,\r\n           sum(avg_value * n) / sum(n) AS co2\r\n    FROM value_hourly\r\n    WHERE bucket < time_bucket(INTERVAL '1 day', now(), 'Australia/Melbourne')\r\n      AND station = 'mstn-2b' AND source = 'co2'\r\n      AND section = 'values' AND key = 'co2_ppm'\r\n    GROUP BY 1\r\n)\r\nSELECT to_char(day_start AT TIME ZONE 'Australia/Melbourne', 'DD Mon') AS day,\r\n       co2\r\nFROM daily\r\nORDER BY day_start",
